=\"mt-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"stat label\">\n                            logements occupés\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"stat two\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[24px] font-black tracking-[-0.06em] text-slate-950\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"stat value\">\n                            78 %\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"stat label\">\n                            via Mobile Money\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"stat three\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[24px] font-black tracking-[-0.06em] text-slate-950\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"stat value\">\n                            1 clic\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"stat label\">\n                            pour la quittance\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-4\" data-name=\"stat four\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[24px] font-black tracking-[-0.06em] text-slate-950\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"stat value\">\n                            Bénin\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"stat label\">\n                            pensé pour ici\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"timeline-title\" class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1240px] px-6 py-28 lg:px-10 lg:py-36\" data-kid=\"2-3-3\" data-name=\"timeline section\">\n            <div class=\"grid gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr]\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"timeline grid layout\">\n                <div class=\"reveal lg:sticky lg:top-32 lg:self-start\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-1\" data-name=\"timeline content column\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[12px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-indigo-700\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"timeline top label\">\n                        Le changement, étape par étape\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-4 max-w-[430px] text-[clamp(2.7rem,4.3vw,3.65rem)] font-black leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.07em] text-slate-950\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"timeline title\" id=\"timeline-title\">\n                        Moins de relances. Plus de visibilité.\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-6 max-w-[390px] text-[17px] leading-8 text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-1-3\" data-name=\"timeline description\">\n                        Loka ne vous demande pas de changer votre métier. L'outil enlève simplement les détours qui vous prennent du temps.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"relative pl-8 sm:pl-16\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2\" data-name=\"timeline steps column\">\n                    <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute bottom-6 left-[11px] top-6 w-px bg-sky-100 sm:left-[27px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"vertical divider line\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"reveal relative mb-14 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-[150px_1fr] sm:gap-10\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"step one\">\n                        <span class=\"absolute -left-[31px] top-1 flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-4 border-white bg-slate-300 sm:-left-[37px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"step indicator\">\n                            <span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-white\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"indicator dot\">\n                            </span>\n                        </span>\n                        <div data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"step label wrapper\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"step top label\">\n                                Avant\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] font-bold text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"step subtitle\">\n                                Cahier · Excel\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"border-b border-slate-100 pb-10\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"step content wrapper\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-[26px] font-black tracking-[-0.05em] text-slate-700\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"step title\">\n                                Chercher le bon chiffre\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[470px] text-[16px] leading-7 text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"step description\">\n                                Les règlements sont dispersés, les dates se recoupent, les quittances s'improvisent au moment où le locataire les demande.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"reveal relative mb-14 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-[150px_1fr] sm:gap-10\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-3\" data-name=\"step two\">\n                        <span class=\"absolute -left-[32px] top-1 flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-4 border-white bg-indigo-700 text-white sm:-left-[38px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"step indicator\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ph ph-check text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"check icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                        <div data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"step label wrapper\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-indigo-700\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"step top label\">\n                                Avec Loka\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] font-bold text-indigo-900/60\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"step subtitle\">\n                                Un tableau, une source\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"border-b border-indigo-100 pb-10\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-3-3\" data-name=\"step content wrapper\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-[26px] font-black tracking-[-0.05em] text-indigo-900\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"step title\">\n                                Voir ce qui est payé, maintenant\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[470px] text-[16px] leading-7 text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"step description\">\n                                Chaque paiement MTN MoMo, Moov Money ou virement rejoint automatiquement votre portefeuille et alimente la quittance correspondante.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"reveal relative grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-[150px_1fr] sm:gap-10\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-4\" data-name=\"step three\">\n                        <span class=\"absolute -left-[32px] top-1 flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-4 border-white bg-indigo-700 text-white sm:-left-[38px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"step indicator\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ph ph-arrow-up-right text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"arrow up right icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                        <div data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"step label wrapper\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-indigo-700\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"step top label\">\n                                Résultat\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] font-bold text-indigo-900/60\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"step subtitle\">\n                                Une gestion plus nette\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-4-3\" data-name=\"step content wrapper\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-[26px] font-black tracking-[-0.05em] text-slate-950\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-4-3-1\" data-name=\"step title\">\n                                Décider avant de relancer\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[470px] text-[16px] leading-7 text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-4-3-2\" data-name=\"step description\">\n                                Vous savez qui doit quoi, ce qui a été envoyé et ce qui mérite votre attention — sans refaire les comptes.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"features-title\" class=\"border-y border-sky-100 bg-slate-50 py-28 lg:py-36\" data-kid=\"2-3-4\" data-name=\"features section\" id=\"fonctionnalites\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1240px] px-6 lg:px-10\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"features container\">\n                <div class=\"reveal flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-end\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-1\" data-name=\"features header\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"features intro column\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[12px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-indigo-700\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"features top label\">\n                            Les outils qui comptent\n                        </p>\n                        <h2 class=\"mt-4 max-w-[650px] text-[clamp(2.8rem,4.6vw,3.8rem)] font-black leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.075em] text-slate-950\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"features title\" id=\"features-title\">\n                            Une ligne claire entre le paiement et la confiance.\n                        </h2>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"max-w-[290px] text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"features intro text\">\n                        Des actions courtes, des documents propres, un espace que vos locataires comprennent.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div aria-label=\"Fonctionnalités Loka\" class=\"mt-14 flex snap-x gap-5 overflow-x-auto pb-8 [scrollbar-width:none] [&::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-2\" data-name=\"features grid\">\n                    <article class=\"reveal min-w-[300px] snap-start border-t-2 border-indigo-700 bg-white p-7 sm:min-w-[370px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"feature card one\">\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ph ph-device-mobile text-[38px] text-indigo-700\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"mobile icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        <p class=\"mt-16 text-[12px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-indigo-700\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"feature label\">\n                            01 · Encaisser\n                        </p>\n                        <h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[28px] font-black tracking-[-0.06em] text-slate-950\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"feature title\">\n                            Recevoir sans déplacement\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] leading-7 text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-2-1-4\" data-name=\"feature description\">\n                            MTN MoMo, Moov Money ou carte : le locataire paie depuis son téléphone.\n                        </p>\n                    </article>\n                    <article class=\"reveal min-w-[300px] snap-start border-t-2 border-indigo-700 bg-white p-7 sm:min-w-[370px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-2-2\" data-name=\"feature card two\">\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ph ph-file-text text-[38px] text-indigo-700\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"file text icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        <p class=\"mt-16 text-[12px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-indigo-700\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"feature label\">\n                            02 · Émettre\n                        </p>\n                        <h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[28px] font-black tracking-[-0.06em] text-slate-950\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"feature title\">\n                            Une quittance, tout de suite\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] leading-7 text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"feature description\">\n                            Le PDF est généré, archivé et prêt à être partagé sous votre nom ou votre logo.\n                        </p>\n                    </article>\n                    <article class=\"reveal min-w-[300px] snap-start border-t-2 border-indigo-700 bg-white p-7 sm:min-w-[370px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-2-3\" data-name=\"feature card three\">\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ph ph-buildings text-[38px] text-indigo-700\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"buildings icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        <p class=\"mt-16 text-[12px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-indigo-700\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"feature label\">\n                            03 · Piloter\n                        </p>\n                        <h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[28px] font-black tracking-[-0.06em] text-slate-950\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-2-3-3\" data-name=\"feature title\">\n                            25 logements en un regard\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] leading-7 text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-2-3-4\" data-name=\"feature description\">\n                            Occupation, paiements et retards sont réunis dans une vue que vous pouvez partager.\n                        </p>\n                    </article>\n                    <article class=\"reveal min-w-[300px] snap-start border-t-2 border-indigo-700 bg-white p-7 sm:min-w-[370px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-2-4\" data-name=\"feature card four\">\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ph ph-user-circle text-[38px] text-indigo-700\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"user circle icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        <p class=\"mt-16 text-[12px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-indigo-700\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"feature label\">\n                            04 · Servir\n                        </p>\n                        <h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[28px] font-black tracking-[-0.06em] text-slate-950\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-2-4-3\" data-name=\"feature title\">\n                            Un portail qui rassure\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] leading-7 text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1-2-4-4\" data-name=\"feature description\">\n                            Chaque locataire retrouve ses quittances, son historique et les informations utiles.\n                        </p>\n                    </article>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"efficiency-title\" class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1240px] px-6 py-28 lg:px-10 lg:py-36\" data-kid=\"2-3-5\" data-name=\"efficiency section\">\n            <div class=\"reveal grid overflow-hidden rounded-[32px] bg-indigo-700 text-white lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.15fr]\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1\" data-name=\"efficiency container\">\n                <div class=\"p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-1\" data-name=\"efficiency left column\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[12px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-indigo-200\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-1-1\" data-name=\"efficiency top label\">\n                        Le temps qui revient\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-5 max-w-[430px] text-[clamp(2.8rem,4vw,4rem)] font-black leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.075em]\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-1-2\" data-name=\"efficiency title\" id=\"efficiency-title\">\n                        Combien de temps pourriez-vous récupérer ?\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-6 max-w-[420px] text-[17px] leading-8 text-indigo-100\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-1-3\" data-name=\"efficiency description\">\n                        Pour 15 logements, Loka peut vous faire gagner environ 12 heures par mois sur les suivis et les quittances.\n                    </p>\n                    <a class=\"mt-9 inline-flex min-h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-white px-6 py-3.5 text-[14px] font-bold text-indigo-800 hover:bg-indigo-50 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-white\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-1-4\" data-name=\"efficiency cta\" href=\"#tarifs\">\n                        Tester avec mon portefeuille\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ph ph-arrow-right text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-1-4-1\" data-name=\"arrow right icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-indigo-800/45 p-