                   </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-[#e7e5e4] pt-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"payment amount\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-[12px] text-[#78716c]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-2-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"amount label\">\n                                        Montant reçu\n                                    </span>\n                                    <strong class=\"text-[20px] text-[#312e81]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-2-1-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"amount value\">\n                                        150 000 FCFA\n                                    </strong>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#15803d]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"status badge\">\n                                <span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#15803d]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-2-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"dot\">\n                                </span>\n                                Quittance prête à être envoyée\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"order-1 max-w-xl lg:order-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-2-2\" data-name=\"story content\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#d67a52]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"story kicker\">\n                            Encaisser simplement\n                        </p>\n                        <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-[38px] font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#312e81]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"story heading\">\n                            Le locataire paie où qu’il soit.\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-5 text-[16px] leading-8 text-[#57534e]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"story description\">\n                            Depuis son portail, il choisit MTN MoMo, Moov Money ou la carte bancaire. Vous recevez la confirmation sans appeler, vérifier ou recopier.\n                        </p>\n                        <a class=\"mt-7 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 text-[13px] font-bold text-[#4338ca] underline decoration-[#c7d2fe] underline-offset-4 hover:text-[#d67a52] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-[#4338ca]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"story link\" href=\"#tarifs\">\n                            Découvrir le portail\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ph ph-arrow-up-right text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"arrow icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n                <article class=\"story grid items-center gap-12 border-t border-[#d6d3d1] py-16 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_1fr] lg:gap-24 lg:py-24\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-3\" data-name=\"story component 2\">\n                    <div class=\"max-w-xl\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-3-1\" data-name=\"story content\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#d67a52]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"story kicker\">\n                            Produire sans reprendre\n                        </p>\n                        <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-[38px] font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#312e81]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"story heading\">\n                            Vos quittances portent votre nom.\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-5 text-[16px] leading-8 text-[#57534e]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-3-1-3\" data-name=\"story description\">\n                            Logo, en-tête, coordonnées : chaque document est généré avec les informations de votre agence ou 