                            320 000\n                                    </strong>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-4 flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl border border-[#c7d2fe] bg-white/70 px-4 py-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-4-1-1-3\" data-name=\"management footer\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[11px] text-[#57534e]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-4-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"footer label\">\n                                    Commissions du mois\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"text-[13px] font-bold text-[#4338ca]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-4-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"footer value\">\n                                    8–10% suivis automatiquement\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"order-1 max-w-xl lg:order-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-4-2\" data-name=\"story content\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#d67a52]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"story kicker\">\n                            Gérer à plusieurs\n                        </p>\n                        <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-[38px] font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#312e81]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"story heading\">\n                            Les agences gardent le fil.\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-5 text-[16px] leading-8 text-[#57534e]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-4-2-3\" data-name=\"story description\">\n                            Logements, commissions, reversements : une même source de vérité pour vos équipes et les propriétaires que vous accompagnez.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-4-2-4\" data-name=\"tag list\">\n                            <span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#c7d2fe] bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#4338ca]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-4-2-4-1\" data-name=\"tag 1\">\n                                Multi-propriétaires\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#c7d2fe] bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#4338ca]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-4-2-4-2\" data-name=\"tag 2\">\n                                Bilan mensuel\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n                <article class=\"story grid items-center gap-12 border-t border-[#d6d3d1] py-16 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_1fr] lg:gap-24 lg:py-24\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-5\" data-name=\"story component 4\">\n                    <div class=\"max-w-xl\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-5-1\" data-name=\"story content\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#d67a52]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-5-1-1\" data-name=\"story kicker\">\n                            Rassurer au quotidien\n                        </p>\n                        <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-[38px] font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#312e81]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-5-1-2\" data-name=\"story heading\">\n                            Le locataire n’attend plus une réponse.\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-5 text-[16px] leading-8 text-[#57534e]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-5-1-3\" data-name=\"story description\">\n                            Quittance, historique des paiements et demandes : son espace est simple, accessible et disponible même quand votre journée est pleine.\n                        </p>\n                        <a class=\"mt-7 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 text-[13px] font-bold text-[#4338ca] underline decoration-[#c7d2fe] underline-offset-4 hover:text-[