             <p class=\"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-1-3\">\n                        Déplacez le curseur pour visualiser le temps qui peut être consacré à vos propriétaires et à vos biens.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"reveal mt-12 rounded-[24px] bg-indigo-50 p-6 sm:p-10\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-bold text-[#172033]\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2-1\">\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2-1-1\">\n                            Logements gérés\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"rounded-full bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-indigo-700 shadow-sm\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2-1-2\">\n                            15 logements\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"relative mt-8 h-3 rounded-full bg-indigo-200\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2-2\" data-name=\"slider track\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-[30%] rounded-full bg-indigo-600\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"slider active progress bar\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute left-[30%] top-1/2 h-7 w-7 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full border-4 border-white bg-indigo-600 shadow-md\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"slider handle\">\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mt-10 grid gap-6 border-t border-indigo-200 pt-8 sm:grid-cols-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2-3\">\n                        <div class=\"text-center\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2-3-1\">\n                            <p class=\"tabular text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.05em] text-indigo-700\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2-3-1-1\">\n                                12h\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2-3-1-2\">\n                                économisées chaque mois\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-center\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2-3-2\">\n                            <p class=\"tabular text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.05em] text-[#172033]\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2-3-2-1\">\n                                1 vue\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2-3-2-2\">\n                                pour vos encaissements et documents\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"bg-slate-50 px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 lg:py-28\" data-kid=\"1-3-6\" id=\"tarifs\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-1\">\n                <div class=\"reveal mx-auto max-w-[680px] text-center\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-1-1\">\n                    <p class=\"text-sm font-extrabold text-indigo-600\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-1-1-1\">\n                        Des plans lisibles\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.045em] text-[#172033] sm:text-5xl\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-1-1-2\">\n                        Commencez petit. Grandissez sereinement.\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-1-1-3\">\n                        Choisissez le niveau qui correspond à votre portefeuille actuel. Vous pourrez évoluer sans refaire votre organisation.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-14 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-1-2\">\n                    <article class=\"reveal flex flex-col rounded-[22px] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 shadow-sm sm:p-8\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-1-2-1\">\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-3-6-1-2-1-1\">\n                            <span class=\"inline-flex rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-extrabold text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-1-2-1-1-1\">\n                                Starter\n                            </span>\n                            <h3 class=\"mt-6 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.05em] text-[#172033]\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-1-2-1-1-2\">\n                                Gratuit\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-1-2-1-1-3\">\n                                Pour débuter avec 1 à 3 logements.\n                            </p>\n                            <div class=\"my-7 h-px bg-slate-200\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-1-2-1-1-4\">\n                            </div>\n                            <ul class=\"space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-1-2-1-1-5\">\n                                <li class=\"flex gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-1-2-1-1-5-1\">\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ph ph-check text-[18px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-1-2-1-1-5-1-1\" style=\"color:#4f46e5;width:18px;height:18px\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    Quittances PDF standard\n                                </li>\n                                <li class=\"flex gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-1-2-1-1-5-2\">\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ph ph-check text-[18px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-1-2-1-1-5-2-1\" style=\"color:#4f46e5;width:18px;height:18px\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    Suivi des règlements\n                                </li>\n                                <li class=\"flex gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-1-2-1-1-5-3\">\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ph ph-check text-[18px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-1-2-1-1-5-3-1\" style=\"color:#4